  "description": "Playwright UI testing extensions for XUnitAssured. Provides fluent DSL for browser-based UI testing with support for multiple locator strategies (CSS, ARIA roles, labels, test IDs, placeholders, text), page interactions, screenshots, and rich assertions. Built on Microsoft.Playwright.",
